questions.q:
A class plays the idli-vada game with the numbers 1 to 90. They say 'idli' for multiples of 6, 'vada' for multiples of 9 and 'idli-vada' for numbers that are multiples of both. Find:
(a) how many numbers are multiples of 6;
(b) how many numbers are multiples of 9;
(c) how many times 'idli-vada' is said;
(d) how many times just 'idli' and how many times just 'vada' is said;
(e) how many numbers are spoken aloud as plain numbers.
